moval happened between July 1961 and June 1962. However, I'm still uncertain about the exact timing since the monthly data doesn't clearly show when the value dropped to zero.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_9ed86b42cd7b4647a5b10aa7","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\n# Let me properly extract the data with correct column mapping\n# Columns: 0=Date, 1=Total, 2=Paper Total, 3=Gold, 4=Silver, 5=T1890, 6=USNotes, 7=FRNotes, 8=FRBNotes, 9=NBNotes\n\nwith open('/app/resources/treasury_bulletin_1963_01_page_88.txt', 'r') as f:\n    content = f.read()\n\nimport re\nrows = re.findall(r'<tr><td>([^<]+)</td><td>([^<]+)</td><td>([^<]+)</td><td>([^<]+)</td><td>([^<]+)</td><td>([^<]+)</td><td>([^<]+)</td><td>([^<]+)</td><td>([^<]+)</td><td>([^<]+)</td></tr>', content)\n\nprint('Date           | T1890 | Paper Total')\nprint('-' * 45)\nfor row in rows:\n    date = row[0].strip()\n    t1890 = row[5].strip()\n    paper = row[2].strip()\n    \n    # Show only relevant years (1961-1962)\n    if date in ['1961', '1962', '1961-December', '1962-January', '1962-February', '1962-March', '1962-April', '1962-May', '1962-June', '1962-July', '1962-August', '1962-September', '1962-October', '1962-November']:\n        print(f'{date:15} | {t1890:4} | {paper}')\n\""}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
